WEBVTT

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.320
Not that way!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.400
Help her! Quick!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.110
It's pointless.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.800
Don't bother.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.840
Maybe it is, but I can't just do nothing!

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.520
Hey!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.240
Hey!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:56.320
Stop!

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.030
Don't butt in!

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.230
Did you think you could just take my loot?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.060
What did I tell you? 
There's no point in helping her.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.700
Just who <i>is</i> she, anyway?

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.740
An oddball who shows up

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:40.250
like the wind, literally,
wherever there are rare magical beasts.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.760
Ow!

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.700
A freak who fights using 
her mastery of bizarre tools.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.000
She may <i>look</i> sweet,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.900
but she's a problem child 
unlike any this kingdom's ever seen.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:54.750
And that hair color she doesn't bother 
to hide makes it easy to guess her status.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.640
That's why they call her...

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.480
the plundering princess of the hunt:

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.170
the "Marauder Princess."

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:10.820
There we go.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:16.300
Okay, so I'll be taking all of the 
materials from the beasts I killed.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.350
Of course.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.500
You saved us a lot of trouble, 
Princess. We appreciate it.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.450
It's no trouble! 
I wanted the materials, anyway.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.650
It's win-win!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.040
Oh, uh...

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.620
That means both sides come out on top, 
so everybody's smiling!

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.620
Yay, yay! Y'know?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.590
Ah, right. That is good, indeed.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:39.760
Let's hope both sides come out 
smiling every time we meet.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.470
Sure! You can count on me!

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.930
Every magician should use their 
magic to make others smile.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.400
That's the kind of magician I want to be!

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.120
W-Well, thanks for everything!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.380
She's an unusual sort of princess.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.580
Right?

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.440
She's royalty, and yet she's 
a high-ranking adventurer.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.660
Some crazy kinda princess, huh?

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:12.610
That, too, but if she's royalty, 
she could just use magic.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.950
So why does she use those weird tools?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.420
Oh...

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:25.960
Because she...

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:28.890
can't use magic.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.980
<b>The Magical Revolution</b>

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.980
<b>of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady</b>

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.980
<b>The Magical Revolution</b>

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.030
Regarding your upcoming schedule...

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:43.770
As was discussed in the court council,

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:46.110
there is a document seeking 
approval for tax reforms.

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:47.700
Yes, I know.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.520
I'll take care of it today.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.320
Prince Algard, if you would read it, as well...

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.790
A-Anis—

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.770
Father! And Al! Hey there!

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:07.250
Sister...

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.700
You fool!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.350
How does one get so filthy 
first thing in the morning?!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.950
You've been hunting for materials again?

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:18.400
Have you no awareness of your role 
as princess, you foolish girl?!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.750
I-I'm sorry! Please don't hit me!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.040
Corporal punishment in the name 
of discipline is abuse! It's DV!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.500
It's illegal! Criminal! You'll be held liable!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.610
Forced to resign! The kingdom will suffer!

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.730
Wh-What in the world are you talking about?

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.030
<i>Yes! I argued him down! Now's my chance!</i>

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.390
That fool daughter of mine...

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:44.670
Hmm...

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.500
What is it?

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.460
The hide of a gray wolf.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.390
I've heard ordinary swords 
can't even scratch them.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.270
How did she skin it so cleanly?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.530
The Mana Blade that Her Highness 
crafted is dreadfully sharp.

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.710
The study of magical science 
that Her Highness advocates...

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.430
"Magicology," was it?

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.770
It is indeed a thing to be feared. 
Most impressive of her.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:07.960
I swear...

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:13.120
That foolish daughter of mine is 
always so bloody unpredictable!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.730
Just the other day, she said she was 
inventing some new magical tool,

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.580
and then she burned down 
half of the royal villa!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.690
Both His Majesty and the prime minister 
are too soft on that insane princess.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:26.190
Yes, but she did renounce 
her right to the throne.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:29.250
She can't cause any real harm 
holed up in the royal villa.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.870
But if that shady magicology 
of hers gets around,

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.460
it may decimate the dignity of the nobility.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.220
Still, magicology could be of use to us.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.550
If she actually has a knack 
for magic, it could mean...

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.990
Hmph. A simpleton who can't even 
use magic is nothing to us.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.730
You've really done it this time, I see.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.000
Well, some unexpected stuff happened.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:06.820
If you ask me, you yourself are an 
entire bundle of "unexpected."

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.570
It was when you were five 
years old, wasn't it?

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:12.480
When you said out of nowhere 
that you wanted to fly.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:22.350
If I had magic, I could fly...

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.980
With magic... I could fly?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:30.320
<b>The Witch and the Flying Broom</b>

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:30.320
<b>The Witch and the Flying Broom</b>

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:31.780
<b>The Witch and the Flying Broom</b>

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:31.780
<b>The Witch and the Flying Broom</b>

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:44.760
Princess!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.330
You mustn't run in the corridors.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.920
Let me go! I just remembered something!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.500
I have to ask Father!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.570
Ask him for what?

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:57.630
To use magic to fly!

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:03.920
Ever since then, you've done all kinds 
of reckless things in your pursuit of flight.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.860
I did, didn't I?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:12.290
Just how many brooms have been 
sacrificed for your cause?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.400
I sacrificed another one today.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.750
I'll have to get a replacement.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.000
It's good of you to worry about the broom,

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.080
but you should worry 
about yourself, as well.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.160
Thanks.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:32.520
You're the only one who 
understands me, Ilia.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.090
Yes, I understand you 
exceedingly well, Princess.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:42.300
Fantasies about things like being able 
to fly are very common during puberty.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.010
Indeed, I understand.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:45.720
Okay, you don't get it at all.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.580
What will you do now?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.770
If you will be going out, 
I will attend to your hair.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:55.930
Yeah, please do. I'm going to see Tilty.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.490
To perform an examination?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.080
Nope, today we're discussing medication.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.070
Ah...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.550
<i>That</i> matter.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:09.290
You've brought another enormous 
piece of magicite, I see.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:13.970
Right? We should be able to make even 
more effective medicine from this!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.170
Well, I suppose we can try it.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.960
You said you use this 
medicine when fighting.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.380
The side effects don't bother you?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.930
Not at all!

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:28.350
At most, you might get a little hyper, 
and it might be a <i>little</i> addictive.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.560
Your use of "a little" is hilariously scary.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:34.190
You want to use magic so badly 
that you'd get your hands on this?

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.010
You really are crazy.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.820
There's no other way, though.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:43.850
I was born without the ability to use magic.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.830
And I'm royalty! Can you believe it?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.630
It makes things kinda tough.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.930
I don't see the problem. 
Magic isn't that big a deal.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.350
That's not true!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.130
Magic is fantastic! Magic is the best! 
Magic is romantic!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:04.910
"Romantic" again?

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:09.430
You're talking about absurd 
fantasies like flying, right?

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:11.110
Yeah, exactly!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:14.370
Wait, "fantasies"? What?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:18.570
I'd say your doom-and-gloom hobby 
of collecting curses is way more absurd.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.020
Well, for me, it's just a hobby.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.680
I'm not trying to do it 
for anyone else's sake.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.390
But you...

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:30.710
You're doing your research because 
you want to make people smile, right?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.430
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:35.670
Jeez, where'd that come from? 
You're making me blush.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.470
I'd call that statement 
an absurd fantasy, too.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.270
Huh?

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.260
So? Can you fly now?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:45.950
No, I can still only manage low altitudes.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.990
But if I increase the output, 
I think I can go higher!

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.140
If I just shove in even more spirit stones...

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.860
But the safety measures 
that would require...

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.610
What even made you think of doing 
something so needlessly dangerous

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.200
as flying with magic?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.930
What? Haven't you ever wanted to fly?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.170
You're a maverick princess in every 
possible way, you know that?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.400
This kingdom's in real trouble 
with a princess like you.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.630
What? I don't want to hear 
that from a noble lady

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:14.350
who went berserk and almost destroyed 
a marquess's household.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:15.330
Okay?

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.020
Anyway, don't worry about my family!

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.180
We've got Al, so we're totally fine!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:20.920
The royal family's in good hands!

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:24.290
Oh, right. I heard your 
brother's getting married.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.980
What do you think of his fiancée, 
the genius daughter of Duke Magenta?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.010
She's pretty.

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:31.960
That's all you can say?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.870
Well, I haven't really spoken with her.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:39.740
Oh? I thought the duke's family 
and the royal family went way back.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.180
You've never seen her?

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.710
Well... I was pretty young at the time, so...

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.960
I don't really remember.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.640
Oh, so herbal tea is all 
the rage in the castle town?

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:37.180
Yes.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.870
We make it from herbs 
we've picked ourselves.

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:42.840
Really? I'd love to have some with you soon.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.550
What? Oh, but... it's really nothing special...

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.920
Lady Lainie is with Prince Algard again.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:51.240
I don't mind. The time spent with 
you is what gives it meaning.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.750
Wasn't she born a commoner?

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.270
Listening to your stories gives me peace.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:57.730
Yes. Her father was granted the rank 
of baron for his distinguished service.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.730
Well, that is lovely.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:04.080
But for her to spend all her time with 
people as high-ranking as the prince...

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.850
Yes, not to mention that 
the prince is betrothed,

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.990
and he'll be graduating soon.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:14.560
I'm sure he's merely being courteous 
to Baron Cyan's daughter.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.070
I think being considerate of school friends

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.960
is a very admirable trait for a royal to have.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.170
Y-Yes, you're right.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:26.140
If that's what you say, Lady Euphyllia, 
then it's absolutely true!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.450
You're still here?

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.900
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.400
You really went to a lot of trouble.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:53.560
Everyone knows this marriage 
is strictly political.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.840
What's the point of a tea party?

00:12:55.840 --> 00:13:00.340
Formalities such as this are essential 
precisely because it is political.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:05.680
We need to build mutual trust 
and knowledge of each other.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.730
As the ones who will inherit the kingdom—

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:12.030
As usual, you're so perfect, it's disgusting.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.670
I am merely trying to 
fulfill my role as a noble.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.090
Hah. Nobility? Worthless.

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:21.550
Your Highness, please refrain from 
behaving that way here at the castle.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.870
No, not only at the castle. 
At the academy, as well.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:25.830
The academy?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.660
What are you getting at?

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.850
I said the same thing to 
Baron Cyan's daughter,

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:36.680
but I would like you to 
bear it in mind, as well.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.810
You and I are betrothed.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:46.800
To avoid causing unwanted rumors,

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.280
I believe you should choose 
your friends carefully.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:54.850
As if we have the right to choose 
anything for ourselves.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:58.730
But your advice is valuable. 
I'll accept it with gratitude.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.950
You can just let me choose 
who's worthy of being with me.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:04.890
What do you mean?

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:07.750
Do I really have to spell it out?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.870
I thought a duke's genius daughter, 
the noblest noble around,

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.380
would pick up easily on insinuations.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:20.750
Are we done?

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.340
Looks like we both wasted our time.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.650
The brooms in the castle 
really are the best around!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.600
Just look at this! Isn't it great?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:49.070
You truly do love brooms, don't you?

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.240
Yeah, I do!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.400
I love them so much, 
I swept away my right to the throne!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.040
No one is going to laugh at that.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:01.960
A-Al! This isn't what it looks like! 
I'm not stealing it!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.790
I was just cleaning the...

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:10.150
That rebellious phase...

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:14.850
Weather: perfect!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.320
Wind speed: perfect!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.770
Gear: all set!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.720
Safety checks: complete!

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:23.300
It's the perfect night for experimenting!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.390
Please wait a moment.

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:27.350
It's quite cold out tonight.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:30.580
Ooh, you're the best, Ilia! Thanks!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.790
Please remember,

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.480
you mustn't go too high or too fast.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:37.050
If anything goes wrong...

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.920
I know, I know. You worry too much.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.450
Of course I'm going to worry.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.310
I can't allow anything 
to happen to our princess,

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:49.770
and above all, you can't use magic,

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.450
so if anything happens 
in the air, you won't be—

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.670
Well, I'm off! Have some hot tea 
waiting when I get back!

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:03.260
As you wish, Princess.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.780
I'm really flying!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.190
My dream from my previous 
life has come true!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.000
I'm so glad we made it to graduation.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.790
Yeah, really. I almost got 
held back for lack of credits.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.240
You're going back home 
after graduation, right?

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:33.310
So this is our last soirée at this academy.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:36.470
Indeed. We are graduating, after all.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.760
So the rumor was true.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.760
Yeah. Her personality's so 
overwhelming that the prince...

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.930
Duke Magenta's daughter is here alone?

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:14.310
What about the prince?

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.090
The prince... Wait, that can't be...

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:21.230
Oh, my goodness! Look at who he's escorting!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:36.870
Everyone, congratulations on graduating.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.510
I'm pleased to have arrived 
at this occasion with all of you.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.480
This is a joyous day for celebrating 
the start of our new lives,

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.820
but there is something 
I need to say to all of you.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:54.830
I hereby declare that I am calling off 
my engagement to Euphyllia Magenta!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.510
The prince just called off 
his own engagement?

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.300
But why would Lady Euphyllia...

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:08.660
Prince Algard, why are you 
calling off our engagement?

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:13.710
I decided that you are not worthy 
of being engaged to me.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:18.900
You can make no excuses for the many 
atrocities you've committed against Lainie!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.950
If you're speaking of the advice 
I gave to Lady Lainie,

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.200
I meant no ill will against her!

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:31.050
Has the king agreed with your decision?

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:33.560
I'll get my father's approval later.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:38.420
How could you call off the engagement your 
father chose for you without his consent?!

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.050
Who should I feel afraid of?

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.720
Times change!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.220
I will choose my own path 
at my own discretion!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.890
But there are certain standards 
to which you must adhere!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.910
Please reconsider!

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:52.230
Have you truly become so blind?

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.580
You have the nerve to call me blind?

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.360
You are the blind one, Euphyllia!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:19:00.940
You want to be queen so badly, 
you refuse to see anything else!

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:02.580
That makes you unworthy!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:06.030
Lainie has endured excessive 
bullying, stealing, and harm—

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.240
even plans to have her assassinated!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:13.440
And I know you were behind all of it!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.920
I've told you, I have no idea what—

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.380
I can testify.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:22.100
We have witnessed the many evil deeds 
she has orchestrated against Lady Lainie.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:24.770
Lainie may have been born a commoner,

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.020
but the reprehension against her 
has been taken too far.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.040
Apparently, she forced her followers

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.260
to harass Lady Lainie so that she 
wouldn't get her own hands dirty.

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:37.440
<i>What... is going on?</i>

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:46.910
<i>I considered it my duty...</i>

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.220
<i>I wanted to set an example for others,</i>

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:55.440
<i>to be strong and righteous as the 
future queen and a baron's daughter...</i>

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.640
Too bad, Euphyllia.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.180
Repent for all the wrong you've done,

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:01.930
and apologize to Lainie.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.600
I...

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:44.450
Ow... Total control failure...

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.420
You're...

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.840
Oh, Al! Hiyas!

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:52.310
Sister...

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:56.990
Uh, did I... drop in at a bad time?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.950
Hey, c'mon, Al.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:05.020
Why are you waiting on another girl 
when Lady Euphyllia is right there?

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:06.400
That's none of your business!

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.190
Hey, no need to get so angry.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.450
Jeez, he's super pissed. 
Talk about scary. What's his deal?

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:13.710
Lady Euphyllia?

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.870
So, uh, what's going on?

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.120
Is she his prospective 
mistress or something?

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:31.420
Wait, did he... call off your engagement?

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:36.720
Oh, man! For real? That actually happens?

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.340
All right! I've decided!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.880
I'll take you away!

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:10.190
C'mon, let's go! Right now!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:14.490
Up you go!

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:17.400
Wh-Wha... Wait! Please put me down!

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:20.690
So anyway, Al...

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:23.810
I'll just take this little story back home.

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:25.110
Wait!

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:35.910
Sister!

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:44.410
W-We're flying?!

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:47.350
Welcome to your journey through 
the skies, Lady Euphyllia!

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:51.860
<i>The story you are about to hear</i>

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:54.930
<i>is the story of two young girls 
from a certain kingdom.</i>

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:57.980
<i>The story of a princess who loved 
magic more than anyone else,</i>

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:01.240
<i>but whom magic did not love in return.</i>

00:23:01.510 --> 00:23:04.120
<i>The story of a noble lady</i>

00:23:04.120 --> 00:23:07.190
<i>who was born with everything, 
but had nothing.</i>

00:23:08.140 --> 00:23:10.850
<i>The story of their revolution.</i>

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:14.360
<i>This is the beginning of that story.</i>

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:17.460
Um, where are we going?

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.720
To see my father and Duke Grantz.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:21.050
Why?

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.720
Because I'm the Marauder Princess.

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:28.210
I'm gonna ask them to let me have you!

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:29.390
Huh?

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:32.430
What?!

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.930
Episode One

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Episode Two
